style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">50,000</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">644,000</span></td></tr><tr style="height:20pt"><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">01/11/26</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:5.2pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%;position:relative;top:-2.8pt;vertical-align:baseline">(6)</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">2018 Equity Incentive Plan</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">125,000</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">985,000</span></td></tr></table></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">(1)&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;These amounts represent threshold, target, and maximum annual bonus amounts under our Executive Incentive Compensation Plan for each named executive officer for fiscal 2026, and do not represent actual compensation earned by our named executive officers for fiscal 2026. The actual payouts approved for fiscal 2026 performance are shown in the Compensation Discussion and Analysis in the last table under the section entitled &#8220;Incentive Plan Performance Metrics and Achievement&#8221;. We currently anticipate that the bonus payouts approved pursuant to the 2021 Executive Incentive Compensation Plan for fiscal 2026 will be paid during the second quarter of fiscal 2027 in the form of fully-vested RSUs.</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">(2)&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;These dollar amounts reflect the aggregate grant date fair value of the awards granted in fiscal 2026. These amounts have been computed in accordance with FASB ASC Topic 718. Pursuant to SEC rules, the amounts shown exclude the impact of estimated forfeitures related to service-based vesting conditions. For a discussion of valuation assumptions, see the notes to our financial statements included in our annual report on Form 10-K for the fiscal year ended January 31, 2026.</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">(3)&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;These grants reflect annual bonuses paid out in RSUs pursuant to our Executive Incentive Compensation Plan.</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">(4)&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;These amounts represent performance restricted stock units and are described in further detail above in the section entitled &#8220;Compensation Discussion and Analysis&#8221; and below in the table entitled &#8220;Outstanding Equity Awards at Fiscal Year End.&#8221; The amounts reported reflect the potential number of shares of stock that become eligible for vesting or exercisable pursuant to these performance equity awards if certain financial metrics are achieved. The amount reported in the Threshold column for each award reflects the potential number of shares of stock that become eligible for vesting or exercisable if performance is at the minimum level required for any shares of stock to become eligible for vesting or exercisable. The amount reported in both the Target and Max columns for each award reflect the potential number of shares of stock that become eligible for vesting or exercisable if performance is at the level required for all shares of stock to become eligible for vesting or exercisable.</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">(5)&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;These amounts represent service-based restricted stock units and are described in further detail above in the section entitled &#8220;Compensation Discussion and Analysis&#8221; and below in the table entitled &#8220;Outstanding Equity Awards at Fiscal Year End.&#8221;</span></div><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">(6) &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;These amounts reflect fully-vested RSUs granted pursuant to a separation and settlement agreement and mutual release. </span></div><div style="height:72pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="padding-right:-20.25pt"><span><br/></span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:72pt;width:100%"><div style="padding-right:-18pt"><span><br/></span></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:10pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:145%">Outstanding Equity Awards at Fiscal Year-End for the Fiscal Year Ended January 31, 2026</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:145%">The following table presents information concerning equity awards held by our named executive officers as of January 31, 2026.</span></div><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:17.008%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:10.598%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:10.598%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:10.598%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:10.598%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:10.598%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:10.598%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:10.604%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">&#160;</spa